      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOT SHOT ETHICS (3) boasts a strong record this journey with 10 wins and three minors from 24 tries. Below best last time at Maitland (25.86) in a NG, finishing a 16 length eighth. Expected to go close. O'KEEFE (4) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 7th at Wentworth Park in NG company. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. One of the main contenders. GOOFY ETHICS (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the money last time though when second (29.03) at this track. Form at the trip sound including five wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading chance. SEE THIS (7) is always a threat when he races at this journey.",
